# attrs.ts

- Export identity string + `*AttrStates` const array (boolean keys).
- Do not take N boolean params. Use `applyAttrs(identity, states, values)`.
- Builds `data-slot`, `data-<identity>`, and `data-<state>` via `dataAttrs`.
